{
  "id": "bigville_econ_spoil",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "depends_on": [],
  "self_load_only": true,
  "description": "bigville: PERISHABLE GOODS ROT in the living economy (goods port -- physical properties). Each Good a mover holds carries its catalog perishable/decay/condition (via _good_node); be_spoil decays a held perishable good's freshness once per living tick at its catalog rate, be_spoil_gone discards it when fully rotted. The rich stack's spoilage, now in the living town -- a resident's larder goes off. Mechanical now_epoch publish (like the obligation clock) drives the epoch-guard. be_spoil_stock/_gone extend the same decay to a shop's UNSOLD stock -- a market stall's perishables go off too, not just a resident's larder. ACCELERATED decay (rate grows as a pile degrades -- rot spreads) + empty-pile reset (an emptied pile is fresh again for the next batch).",
  "nodes": [],
  "edges": [],
  "productions": [],
  "concepts": [],
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "be_spoil",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "GOODS ROT IN THE LIVING TOWN: a perishable Good a mover holds (has_good) loses condition by its catalog decay rate once per living tick (epoch-guard on now_epoch, published mechanically like the obligation clock). Fish/bread/milk go off; iron/cloth do not. The catalog's decay drives it. ACCELERATED: rate = decay*(2-condition), so a more-degraded pile rots faster (rot spreads).",
      "match": [
        [
          "mover",
          "has_good",
          "good"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Gt",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "good"
                  },
                  "key": "perishable"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 0.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Gt",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "good"
                  },
                  "key": "qty"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 0.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Gt",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "good"
                  },
                  "key": "condition"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 0.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Lt",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "good"
                  },
                  "key": "decay_epoch"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "good"
                  },
                  "key": "now_epoch"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "set_attr",
          "good",
          "condition",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Max",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                },
                {
                  "type": "Minus",
                  "a": {
                    "type": "Plus",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "type": "Attr",
                        "node": {
                          "type": "Var",
                          "name": "good"
                        },
                        "key": "condition"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "Lit",
                        "value": 0.0
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "b": {
                    "type": "Times",
